|-
|TXSELECT_OUTPUT_LOCKTIME
|0x400
|}

=3D=3D=3DValues For Input Selector and Output Selector Bits=3D=3D=3D

The input selectors, controlling which inputs are enumerated, are bits 11 a=
nd 12:

