|0
|-
|TXSELECT_OUTPUTSELECT_CURRENT
|0x2000
|-
|TXSELECT_OUTPUTSELECT_SINGLE
|0x4000
|-
|TXSELECT_OUTPUTSELECT_RANGE
|0x6000
|}

